  "implementation": "Extract a shared immutable surface/face reference and placement solver. Reuse affine object previews for rigid placements and shared morph display cages with Arc-owned surface data for deformation. Add source/guide/target/scale/angle getters, separate source and destination CPlanes, repeated copy history, stale-guide recovery and trim-aware point resolution. Use measured native face orientation, flipped height and normal projection policies without changing the generic borrowed Splop map.",
