  "native_capture_method": "Actual -OrientOnSrf macros against owned point clouds and authored NURBS/face recipes. Explicit Copy/Rigid/Flip/IgnoreTrims settings; explicit ConstrainNormal yes/no in deformable rows. Restore CPlane and delete only owned objects/groups. Compare all cloud witnesses, original identity, selection, group memberships/definitions and unchanged guides. RunScript true is not sufficient: the tangent-normal row retains its unchanged native model.",
  "point_map_policy": "Project the anchor differential onto the plane perpendicular to the preferred normal with signed orientation. Source height uses anchor obliquity when unflipped; flipped height stays unscaled. New command policy is opt-in and leaves the existing generic Splop constructor/fixed-normal API unchanged.",
